{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2022-12-12 08:00:00', 'title': 'BAKER HUGHES ADDED TO THE NASDAQ-100 INDEX', 'text': 'HOUSTON AND LONDON, DEC. 12, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BAKER HUGHES (NASDAQ: BKR), AN ENERGY TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, ANNOUNCED MONDAY IT HAS BEEN ADDED TO THE NASDAQ-100®\xa0INDEX, THE TOP 100 LARGEST DOMESTIC AND INTERNATIONAL NON-FINANCIAL COMPANIES ON THE NASDAQ BASED ON MARKET CAPITALIZATION. NASDAQ ANNOUNCED THE INCLUSION ON FRIDAY, DEC. 9, WHICH WILL BECOME EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO MARKET OPEN ON\xa0MONDAY, DEC. 19.'}